   "text": "**Q1** · question\n\nCan we break an unmarked 1941 TS message on g-army-ts-messages.html or pass the p1 blind garble-tolerance benchmark (3 texts of 60-100 chars with ~8% Morse garbles, >=95% recovery)?",
   "x": 0,
